<h3 class="@DocsStyles.H3">IStyleBuilder&lt;out T&gt;</h3>

<p class="@DocsStyles.P">
    The base interface declares every utility. <code class="@DocsStyles.InlineCode">T</code> is the builder
    type returned by each call, so chaining preserves the concrete stage. The methods are listed in
    declaration order.
</p>

